worth it\' dates from 1971.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7f72-8a26-1a869456bb1d","description":"Because you\'re worth it","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-703c-9de6-673e5ab5a4c4","description":"Quality never goes out of style","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-72af-b417-344c45336bb5","description":"Maybe she\'s born with it","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-72a6-b68b-82b3d16edb02","description":"It\'s Style","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7a81-ab98-2a3982e5a78c","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"The language \'German\' belongs to which language family?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Indo-European includes branches such as Germanic, Romance, and Slavic; German belongs to the Germanic branch.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7757-aa27-451b1b72286a","description":"Indo-European","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-75b0-a1ed-f8df69ec7db5","description":"Niger\u2013Congo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-77e7-a5c5-dacf06100da9","description":"Afroasiatic","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7a6f-94bf-daa925956714","description":"Dravidian","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7cd8-b028-033848480748","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What colors are traditionally associated with the US Independence Day (4th of July)?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Red, white, and blue are the colors of the US flag, whose star-and-stripe design is a common motif in Independence Day decorations.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-749b-b4cb-999d8d54012b","description":"Red, White, and Blue","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7c69-af03-fa9b2f16c57e","description":"Green, White, and Red","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7b6f-a9a1-602df92ee1be","description":"Yellow, White, and Blue","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7ea6-b1ad-3b3decaedf07","description":"Red, White, and Yellow","correct_answer":false}]}