escription":"Firestorm","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7d42-bebd-4456a81879c9","description":"Stampede","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-70ce-a176-c9afb0168a10","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these is a four-sided spinning top, played during the Jewish holiday of Hanukkah?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A dreidel is often played with a shared pot of tokens, such as chocolate coins; the letter facing up determines what a player does with the pot.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7f85-a0ce-72cbc7029f7b","description":"A dreidel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7c30-8d4e-7d897136a37f","description":"A menorah","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7ed3-bba2-597319967df9","description":"A Torah scroll","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7977-bcd2-86dde5aa8a5f","description":"A shofar","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-71b4-b47b-b93267f2c935","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the slang term for removing body hair from men?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Manscaping blends \u201cman\u201d with \u201clandscaping\u201d to describe styling or removing men\u2019s body hair.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7285-84f1-3d052528d3cb","description":"Manscaping","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7fb1-910d-57f1eece998c","description":"Bodyculture","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-700a-af01-bcd6f41b7bc1","description":"Topihairy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7cee-a485-334e1630f17c","description":"Guydening","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-72f2-a459-0620ce0a573c","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the name of the bandaged walking dead often seen during Halloween, whose name comes from the Persian word for \'wax\'?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A mummy is a preserved body; ancient Egyptian embalmers used natron to dry bodies before wrapping them in linen.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-75bb-acd6-e7db2fea6796","description":"A mummy","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7b63-b843-6c2422ae3f0a","description":"A zombie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7249-b505-e2a2d1038f4b","description":"A skeleton","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7439-aabb-67034660c031","description":"A vampire","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-76ed-b894-de4cb511e2a4","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What did \'my true love give to me\' on the first day of Christmas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A Partridge in a Pear Tree is the gift in the carol\u2019s opening verse. Each succeeding verse adds gifts while repeating those already named.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-73ab-b673-d3d6724936a4","description":"A Partridge In A Pear Tree","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-776b-a134-8aaac37cc95a","description":"5 Gold Rings","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7714-8909-7cd52658e9e6","description":"A Turtle Dove","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-77ec-9c76-9d6c3b0061d8","description":"True Love","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7c58-989b-bd9b3e9c2539","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"After rejoining Apple in 1997, Steve Jobs engineered what ad campaign?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Think Different used portraits of figures such as Albert Einstein and Martin Luther King Jr. to link Apple with creativity and nonconformity.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7795-90cf-b7f275f32bf8","description":"Think Different","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7a05-acf8-8ed25d07c87a","description":"Just Do It","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7fd5-8760-48df077d8f77","description":"I\'m Lovin\' It","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7835-8fe3-75457c9b7c1e","description":"Got Milk?","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7634-9629-94a7b1cf41d3","category":"01a