orrect_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7fc4-bd43-fd1f9daf4418","description":"Oh, Holy Night","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7d05-a44d-63f88d916188","description":"We Three Kings","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7c32-ae5a-2652495482b0","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which toy is a multi-colored block you have to reorganize?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Rubik\'s Cube was created by Hungarian architect Ern\u0151 Rubik and was first called the Magic Cube.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7374-ac5f-7607dfa99af4","description":"Rubik\'s Cube","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7743-9dfc-dfaa36a7b49c","description":"Furby","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-745f-b315-7dc1b38cc20e","description":"Playmobil","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-76b7-9ddb-b3289a280c20","description":"Hula Hoop","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7a36-ad4b-3b73e66f4207","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Who is in charge of the administration of a city?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A mayor typically leads municipal government, while a prime minister heads a national government.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7198-b22b-ac72e57d4d5d","description":"Mayor","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-78b0-b862-f2fbe857eda7","description":"Prime Minister","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-782a-9d7b-fa7f4b0f746a","description":"Cardinal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-70c3-9c4b-cfb3276a8e39","description":"President","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7e91-ad37-5b9c2ab538d8","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the name of the fashion trend popularized in the 1970s that involves wearing bell-bottoms, platform shoes, and oversized shirts?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Disco comes from discoth\u00e8que, a French term for a nightclub where recorded music is played.","alternatives":[{"id":