kes the Mustang?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Ford makes the Mustang, which debuted in 1964 and helped popularize the pony car category.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-744f-bc1f-486ce5ec46e7","description":"Ford","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-76d7-9886-9cc3e489a702","description":"Alfa Romeo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-77af-9a4b-c5d6e09ff874","description":"BMW","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7cfa-8755-fc5d6dab9eec","description":"Austin","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7fb5-a6c5-8536b0dfc56c","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"In Greek myth, what happened if you looked a Gorgon in the eye?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Looking directly at a Gorgon turned you to stone; Perseus used his shield as a mirror to avoid that fate when facing Medusa.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7009-aee7-85f7e6fafd2f","description":"You turned to stone","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-782a-b4cc-5b35ddb13be8","description":"You fell in love","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7ff1-912c-5821e8294355","description":"You went blind","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7fc0-b2af-4a74d2acdfc3","description":"You lost your voice","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7bba-a916-6f0d9767f18a","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the marketing slogan of Burger King?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Burger King\u2019s Have It Your Way campaign emphasized customized orders and was introduced in 1974.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7772-9069-f83883dac753","description":"Have it your way","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7f63-8240-8acd82598af2","description":"A glass and a half in every half pound","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-795e-a898-591182ede495","description":"Finger lickin\' good","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae8e-7c7b-8e6a-129fde4ad5de","description":"Snap! Crackle! Pop!","corr